From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AltarsCN <337293323+Altars3668@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 00:29:55 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] combase: Implement
 Windows.Foundation.Diagnostics.AsyncCausalityTracer.

Office's asynchronous operations ask for the tracer that tells a
debugger where they begin and end, a class combase has on Windows; Wine
had no such class.  As on Windows 11 the factory is the only object,
agile, with the statics and no instances or class name; traces check
their level and source and go nowhere, as nothing here listens for
them, and status handlers are kept and dropped (tools/startupgapsprobe
causality).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

